      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1355312416,
      "text": "Holochlamys is a monotypic genus of flowering plants in the family Araceae. Holochlamys beccarii is the only species in the genus Holochlamys. It is native to New Guinea and the Bismarck Archipelago and is found growing in mud near lowland streams or rocky streambeds at high elevations."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Holochlamys beccarii",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holochlamys_beccarii",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 135204744,
      "text": "Holochlamys es un género de plantas con flores de la familia Araceae. Su única especie, Holochlamys beccarii (Engl.) Engl., es originaria de Nueva Guinea hasta el archipiélago de Bismarck."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Holochlamys",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holochlamys",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 65725949,
      "text": "Holochlamys é um género de plantas com flor pertencente à família Araceae. O género é monotípico, tendo como única espécie Holochlamys beccarii."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Holochlamys",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holochlamys",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29567104,
      "text": "Holochlamys adalah genus monotipe dari tumbuhan berbunga dalam famili Araceae. Holochlamys beccarii adalah satu-satunya spesies dalam genus Holochlamys. Tumbuhan ini berasal dari Nugini dan Kepulauan Bismarck dan ditemukan tumbuh di lumpur di dekat aliran sungai dataran rendah atau dasar sungai berbatu di ketinggian."
    }
